5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting. I suspect the longevity of our previous schemes may be quite telling.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I will look into the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site. I want to understand the practicalities of the construction phase.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'll check the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services! I want to see how much it actually costs to keep the park looking pretty.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I will examine the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division. I need to understand the actual human resources available for long-term maintenance.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I will review the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings. I want to understand how the park is actually used and how it handles environmental stress.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
