79,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I vote for Candidate A. It is the only plan that is operationally sustainable given our current human resources. Any other choice would be a failure of planning.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
